| Responsibility | Owner |
|---|---|
| Product and architecture direction, major decisions | {{OWNER_ROLE}} |
| Roadmap, Goal, Work Spec, Plan review, acceptance, PROGRESS | {{SUPERVISOR_AGENT}} |
